WEBVTT

00:27:57.663 --> 00:28:04.621
So I didn't have this, you know, when when
there were these male scientists,

00:28:04.621 --> 00:28:07.996
when I discovered tool using saying, well,
why should we believe her?

00:28:08.038 --> 00:28:10.288
She's just a girl. She doesn't
have a degree.

00:28:10.913 --> 00:28:14.371
She's only got money from the geographic
cause she's got nice legs.

00:28:15.871 --> 00:28:19.079
All I cared about was getting back
and learning about the chimps.

00:28:19.079 --> 00:28:23.496
I didn't even want to be a scientist. It
was Leakey who made me to the degree.

00:28:23.496 --> 00:28:24.621
And I'm really glad he did.

00:28:24.663 --> 00:28:30.413
By the way, I loved learning how to think
in, you know, in a scientific,